---
// Direct visual showdown:
// Top row: saturated white-on-color alert (fails WCAG AA or visually screams) vs flipped contrast (dark 900 text on light 100 tint, > 10:1).
// Bottom row: color-only status dots (unreadable in red-green CVD) vs color + icon + lightness contrast.

const W = 900;
const H = 310;
const padL = 24;
const colW = 412;
const rightX = padL + colW + 28;
---

<figure class="ccf">
  <div class="ccf-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Left: white text on bright amber badge with low 2.15:1 contrast and color-only status dots. Right: flipped dark text on pale amber tint achieving 8.15:1 contrast and status paired with icons and labels.">
      {/* Column headers */}
      <text x={padL} y="24" class="ccf-h-bad">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Avoid: light text on bright color, color-only signals</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tránh: chữ trắng trên nền rực, báo trạng thái chỉ bằng màu</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={rightX} y="24" class="ccf-h-good">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Prefer: flip the contrast, pair color with shape</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nên làm: đảo tương phản, kết hợp màu với hình khối</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Row 1: Alert contrast showdown */}
      <rect x={padL} y="40" width={colW} height="96" rx="8" fill="var(--bg-alt)" class="ccf-frame" />
      <rect x={padL + 16} y="56" width={colW - 32} height="48" rx="6" fill="#f59e0b" />
      <text x={padL + 30} y="85" fill="#ffffff" class="ccf-alert-txt">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Payment retry scheduled in 15 min</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thử lại thanh toán sau 15 phút</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={padL + 16} y="124" class="ccf-ratio-bad">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Contrast 2.15:1 — fails WCAG AA (4.5:1)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tương phản 2.15:1 — rớt chuẩn WCAG AA (4.5:1)</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x={rightX} y="40" width={colW} height="96" rx="8" fill="var(--bg-alt)" class="ccf-frame" />
      <rect x={rightX + 16} y="56" width={colW - 32} height="48" rx="6" fill="#fef3c7" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="1.2" />
      <text x={rightX + 30} y="85" fill="#78350f" class="ccf-alert-txt">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Payment retry scheduled in 15 min</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thử lại thanh toán sau 15 phút</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x={rightX + 16} y="124" class="ccf-ratio-good">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Contrast 8.15:1 — passes WCAG AAA and stays calm</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tương phản 8.15:1 — đạt chuẩn AAA, dịu mắt hơn</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Row 2: Color-only vs color + icon */}
      <rect x={padL} y="158" width={colW} height="122" rx="8" fill="var(--bg-alt)" class="ccf-frame" />
      <text x={padL + 16} y="182" class="ccf-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Color only (hard to separate in red-green CVD)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chỉ dùng màu (khó phân biệt nếu mù màu đỏ-xanh)</tspan>
      </text>
      <circle cx={padL + 28} cy="212" r="6" fill="#16a34a" />
      <text x={padL + 44} y="217" class="ccf-row">API latency: 42 ms</text>
      <text x={padL + colW - 18} y="217" text-anchor="end" fill="#16a34a" class="ccf-val">12%</text>

      <circle cx={padL + 28} cy="244" r="6" fill="#dc2626" />
      <text x={padL + 44} y="249" class="ccf-row">Error rate: 1.8%</text>
      <text x={padL + colW - 18} y="249" text-anchor="end" fill="#dc2626" class="ccf-val">12%</text>

      <rect x={rightX} y="158" width={colW} height="122" rx="8" fill="var(--bg-alt)" class="ccf-frame" />
      <text x={rightX + 16} y="182" class="ccf-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Color + direction arrow + explicit sign</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Màu + mũi tên hướng + dấu rõ ràng</tspan>
      </text>
      {/* Down-good arrow polygon */}
      <polygon points={`${rightX + 22},209 ${rightX + 34},209 ${rightX + 28},218`} fill="#15803d" />
      <text x={rightX + 44} y="217" class="ccf-row">API latency: 42 ms</text>
      <text x={rightX + colW - 18} y="217" text-anchor="end" fill="#15803d" class="ccf-val">↓ -12%</text>

      {/* Up-bad arrow polygon */}
      <polygon points={`${rightX + 28},239 ${rightX + 22},248 ${rightX + 34},248`} fill="#b91c1c" />
      <text x={rightX + 44} y="249" class="ccf-row">Error rate: 1.8%</text>
      <text x={rightX + colW - 18} y="249" text-anchor="end" fill="#b91c1c" class="ccf-val">↑ +12%</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Flipping dark text onto a light tint solves contrast without heavy, shouting banners. Pairing arrows and +/- signs with color keeps metrics legible for every reader.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Đảo sang chữ đậm trên nền nhạt giúp đạt chuẩn tương phản mà không gây nặng nề. Kèm mũi tên và dấu +/- giúp số liệu vẫn đọc tốt dù không thấy màu.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ccf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ccf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ccf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ccf text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .ccf text.ccf-h-bad { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
  .ccf text.ccf-h-good { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ccf text.ccf-alert-txt { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }
  .ccf text.ccf-ratio-bad { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--red); }
  .ccf text.ccf-ratio-good { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ccf text.ccf-sub { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ccf text.ccf-row { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text); }
  .ccf text.ccf-val { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
  .ccf-frame { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .ccf figcaption { margin-top: 0.6em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
